# Motion

- **Utility only**: hover/focus/state transitions use `--motion-duration`
  (~160ms) + `--motion-easing`. No entrance animations, no parallax,
  no skeleton shimmer theatrics.
- **Live pulse** is the single expressive animation: the green dot next to a
  live minute/match. Slow (~2s), subtle opacity/scale pulse.
- **`prefers-reduced-motion`**: pulse becomes static, transitions drop to
  none. Always honored.
- Forbidden: animated gradients, bouncing icons, confetti/celebration
  effects, auto-scrolling tickers.
